<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, You are glory, You are beauty;</l><l>Divine and human woven utterly</l><l>Have mercy on me, that I may be</l><l>Joined to You, expressing You daily.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, be my pattern, humble and lowly;</l><l>Save me from self and pride and vainglory.</l><l>Preserve and keep me, for Your economy,</l><l>Live in me, possess me wholly.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, I do love You, operate in me,</l><l>Be my salvation, save me constantly</l><l>To hold forth Your word, life to others afford;</l><l>Shining You, so radiantly, dear Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Lord, I’m so saturated with Your joy</l><l>That I am drunken, You as wine enjoy;</l><l>I’d pour out my being, as a drink offering</l><l>Upon You, God satisfying.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Lord, my desire is to be found in You</l><l>As lived out righteousness, give me this view.</l><l>Lord, clothe and stitch me, with embroidery</l><l>Day by day, inwrought Your gold in me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
